# Testing and Verification

- Run focused tests for changed backend modules and full test suite before release-sensitive changes.
- Keep Jest scope limited to project tests; exclude temporary/worktree mirrors.
- Avoid `--forceExit` as a default once open-handle issues are resolved.
- Validate frontend production build (`web` Vite build) after UI/API contract changes.
- When fixing bugs, add regression tests where practical.
